Z||000000||Wade87GT||05-21-2001||10:41 PM||||As much as Pontiac wants to forget about us, would our Fieros qualify? Buried in the classifieds, events section, of the May 21st, issue of AutoWeek, is the info about the show. It's on June 3. For more info call 734-482-5200. All you locals should gang up on them. That would say something! Apparently, there's also an air museum nearby with a B-17 and others. <A HREF="http://www.yankeeairmuseum.org/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.yankeeairmuseum.org/</A> <P>What other cars (companies still in business) would you consider to be an orphan in this country? Foreign or domestic.<BR>||||reg||10
Z||000001||stimpy||05-22-2001||09:21 AM||||Other orphans, or should we say abandoned children?<BR>The Corvair<BR>anything French<BR>anything Fiat<BR>the Sterling<P>I'm sure I'll come up with more.||||reg||1
